			"date": "2025-03-24T14:05:57.410Z",
			"content": "<p>Update: looks like a huge flaw somewhere in the vulnerability scanner code being used by these tools (it doesn’t support namespaced packages)</p>\n<p>More info:<br>\n- <a href=\"https://github.com/jridgewell/gen-mapping/issues/12\">github.com/jridgewell/g...</a><br>\n- <a href=\"https://github.com/anchore/grype/issues/1701\">github.com/anchore/gryp...</a><br>\n- It’s referencing this report from 2022 <a href=\"https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-8rmg-jf7p-4p22\">github.com/advisories/G...</a></p>",
			"via": "bluesky"
		},
